7. Conclusion
SaaS provides an efficient and cost-effective solution for developing a cloud-based attendance management system in colleges. It reduces paperwork, saves time, improves accuracy, and allows faculty members and students to access attendance records from anywhere. Although internet dependency and data security are possible challenges, they can be managed through reliable internet connectivity and proper security measures.

Therefore, implementing a SaaS-based attendance management system helps colleges improve their attendance management process and move towards digital education.


